        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: సాధించు",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "సాధించు — sādhiñcu — \"to achieve; to accomplish\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "పట్టుదలతో ఆమె తన లక్ష్యం సాధించింది. paṭṭudalatō āme tana lakṣyaṁ sādhiñcindi. With determination she achieved her goal."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (I …): సాధించాను, sādhiñcānu."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Its noun సాధన is practice."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "సాధించు (sādhiñcu) is built on Sanskrit sādhana, \"furthering; completion\" (CDIAL 13334), with the Telugu verb ending -ఇంచు."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for describing what you lived and felt."
            }
          ]
        },
