              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "రాజీనామా — rājīnāmā — \"a resignation\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "జీతం సరిపోక అతను రాజీనామా చేశాడు. jītaṁ saripōka atanu rājīnāmā cēśāḍu. His pay was not enough, so he resigned."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "రాజీనామా (rājīnāmā) చేయు, to resign."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "రాజీనామా (rājīnāmā) is a loan from Persian rāzīnāma, \"a written agreement, a letter of consent\", which reached Telugu through Hindustani."
            }
